<section class="lp-section" id="staffing-and-cost"><div class="lp-wrap">
  <div class="lp-heading"><h2>What does outsourced SDR staffing cost?</h2><p>Check the full bill for staffing, management and data. Each can appear as a separate charge.</p></div>
  <div class="shortlist-models">
    <article><h3>Dedicated SDR</h3><p>You pay for an assigned rep’s time. Check who coaches them and who calls when they’re away.</p></article>
    <article><h3>Managed calling team</h3><p>You pay for a team to run the campaign. Set the account list, follow-up rules and reporting schedule together.</p></article>
    <article><h3>Base fee plus meeting charges</h3><p>Put the billing trigger and replacement terms in the proposal. Forecast the bill at the number of meetings you expect your sales team to accept.</p></article>
  </div>
  <p class="shortlist-note">Use CallTeam’s <a href="/b2b-outbound-campaign-planner/">B2B campaign planner</a> to brief each provider on the same buyers and offer.</p>

  <div class="shortlist-example" id="pricing-example">
    <h3>Convert billing cycles into a budget</h3>
    <div class="sg-table-wrap"><table class="lp-table sg-table" role="table">
      <caption>Examples before tax or scoped extras. The rows cover different staffing models.</caption>
      <thead><tr role="row"><th scope="col" role="columnheader">Example</th><th scope="col" role="columnheader">How the bill works</th><th scope="col" role="columnheader">Calculated base cost</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr role="row"><th scope="row" role="rowheader">CallTeam starting scope</th><td role="cell" data-label="How the bill works">US$4,000 × 3 calendar months</td><td role="cell" data-label="Calculated base cost">US$12,000 for three months</td></tr>
        <tr role="row"><th scope="row" role="rowheader">SalesRoads one dedicated SDR</th><td role="cell" data-label="How the bill works">$11,950 × 13 four-week cycles</td><td role="cell" data-label="Calculated base cost">$155,350 over 52 weeks, or about $12,946 per calendar month</td></tr>
        <tr role="row"><th scope="row" role="rowheader">CIENCE one US- or Europe-based SDR</th><td role="cell" data-label="How the bill works">$2,000 for the team + $499 for the platform + $3,500 for the rep</td><td role="cell" data-label="Calculated base cost">$5,999 a month before setup and any bonus</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table></div>
    <p class="shortlist-note">The SalesRoads calculation assumes continuous coverage for 52 weeks. Most CallTeam campaigns begin with an initial three-month engagement. Ask each provider for the cancellation terms and total bill for the period you plan to buy.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="shortlist-feature"><h3>Compare the outcomes sales accepts</h3><p>Ask the agency to report bookings, held meetings and meetings your sales team accepted. If a $6,000 month produces eight held meetings that sales accepts, the cost is $750 per accepted meeting. Use your own numbers in the <a href="/articles/b2b-appointment-setting-cost/">B2B appointment setting cost guide</a>.</p></div>
